# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What is NOT ignored, and why it matters
#
#   data/seasons/<id>/recaps/*.json
#                        The permanent archive of DartConnect match payloads,
#                        one directory per season of either league.
#                        COMMIT THESE. DartConnect owes us nothing and could
#                        change its format or withdraw access at any time; once
#                        a match is archived it is ours, and every number the
#                        site publishes is rebuilt from these files.
#   data/seasons/<id>/{matches,standings,fixtures}.json
#                        A season's schedule, standings and fixtures, refreshed
#                        while it is active. Commit them.
#   data/seasons.json    Every season of both leagues. Commit it.
#   design/assets/       Copied into the built site. Commit them.
#
# Never add data/ or *.json to this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Legacy export from the old yourleaguestats.com site. Kept on the owner's disk for
# reference only: no code reads it, and it is not ours to publish in a public repo.
/Park Slope Dart League (PSDL) - Stats.csv

# Generated site. Rebuilt from the archive by `python3 site/build.py`, which
# deletes and recreates the whole directory, so there is nothing here to keep.
# GitHub Actions builds and deploys it; it is not committed.
public/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
# Anchored to the repo root so they cannot shadow site/build.py's directory.
/build/
/dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

